        {
            "key": "StartReplica1",
            "value": "Who am I..."
        },
        {
            "key": "StartReplica2",
            "value": "Where am I..."
        },
        {
            "key": "InsideVoice",
            "value": "Inner voice"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep1",
            "value": "Hi! I'm your inner helper. You can call me the inner voice."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep2",
            "value": "You probably don't understand who you are and where you are... But I will help you with this!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep3",
            "value": "Now you are on the mainland of Antania. It was captured by the megasecomes and humanity decided to rename the continent."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep4",
            "value": "What? You don't know who the megasecomes are?!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep5",
            "value": "Megasecomes are insects mutated as a result of an experiment conducted by a scientist..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep6",
            "value": "The name of this scientist is classified information, I'm sorry, I can't share it..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep7",
            "value": "Well, you seem to have the basic information."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep8",
            "value": "By the way, what's your name?"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep9",
            "value": "Don't know... You didn't say..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep10",
            "value": "Oh, yeah... I'll fill you in..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep11",
            "value": "You, my friend, are a cuber. That is, a robot created by mankind to fight megasecomes."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep12",
            "value": "Hmm... I don't think your name is in my database..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep13",
            "value": "Apparently people didn't give you a name... Well, so that you won't be nameless, we'll come up with a name for you. Which one do you want?"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep14",
            "value": "Enter a name..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep15",
            "value": "Great! Then let's start learning!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial1Rep16",
            "value": "First, let's learn how to jump. To make a jump, click on the big button on the right side of the screen."
        },
        {
            "key": "TakeName",
            "value": "Enter a name..."
        },
        {
            "key": "ConfirmName",
            "value": "Confirm name"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial2Rep1",
            "value": "Be careful! Touching these spikes, you will instantly explode!"
        },
        {
            "key": "TutorialMoneyRep1",
            "value": "Oh, it's money!"
        },
        {
            "key": "TutorialMoneyRep2",
            "value": "Be sure to collect money! With these you will be able to buy resources!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial3Rep1",
            "value": "It looks like a dungeon. According to my data, there is a village behind this dungeon."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial3Rep2",
            "value": "Jump quickly!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial3Rep3",
            "value": "Oh no..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial4Rep1",
            "value": "Be careful! There's a praying mantis up there!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial4Rep2",
            "value": "I don't advise you to fight him, you're still too weak. Better get around him."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial5Rep1",
            "value": "Looks like we got out. Go meet the other cubers."
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial6Rep1",
            "value": "It's a blacksmith shop!"
        },
        {
            "key": "Tutorial6Rep2",
            "value": "That's what we call a universal machine for creating modules, but it seems that in this village everything was taken literally..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Levan",
            "value": "Levan"
        },
        {
            "key": "LevanBaseDialogRep1",
            "value": "Hi. How are you doing?"
        },
        {
            "key": "LevanBaseDialogRep2",
            "value": "It's all good."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain1Rep1",
            "value": "Hey! I haven't seen you here before... Are you new? What's your name?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain1Rep3",
            "value": "Oh, you're really new!"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain1Rep4",
            "value": "My name is Levan. I am a guide for new cubers, as well as a resident of this village."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain1Rep5",
            "value": "Nice to meet you."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain1Rep6",
            "value": "I think you should look around our village. Meet the cubers!"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain2Rep1",
            "value": "Hi. I am Abdul, a local blacksmith and salesman."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain2Rep2",
            "value": "You seem to be new. We manufacture modules at this forge. If you need anything, contact us."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain2Rep3",
            "value": "Thank you."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain2Rep4",
            "value": "Be careful, other cubers don't have an internal voice, they get information directly from the database."
        },
        {
            "key": "Abdul",
            "value": "Abdul"
        },
        {
            "key": "AbdulBaseRep1",
            "value": "Don't need a new module?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep1",
            "value": "Well how? Have you met?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep2",
            "value": "If you want to train before the fight, there is a special training house with a basement in our village."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep3",
            "value": "Listen, this is my first time on this mainland, can you advise me?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep4",
            "value": "Of course! Then listen carefully."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep5",
            "value": "Leaving the village you will find yourself in a quiet forest. Wild mantises live there."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep6",
            "value": "By killing them, you can gain experience and resources that you can later use to create items."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep7",
            "value": "The items themselves can be created at the forge. You probably decided that only modules are made on it?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep8",
            "value": "In general, this is all I know, because I am on duty and I accept new people. I don't go outside the village at all."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep9",
            "value": "By the way, since you have nothing to do, I suggest you help Abdul."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep10",
            "value": "It seems that Bogomgrad has stopped supplying us with resources. But you'd better ask Abdul himself."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep11",
            "value": "OK, thanks for the information!"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain3Rep12",
            "value": "You could have asked me about the mainland..."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep1",
            "value": "Hi. Levan said you needed help."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep2",
            "value": "And you came to help me?"
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep3",
            "value": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep4",
            "value": "Great! Then listen."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep5",
            "value": "Until recently, Bogomgrad supplied our village with resources, but it stopped and I want to find out the truth."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep6",
            "value": "Go to Bogomgrad and find out what's going on."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep7",
            "value": "The name of our supplier is Vitaly."
        },
        {
            "key": "TopOfTheFoodChain4Rep8",
            "value": "Good. No problem."
        },
        {
            "key": "Richard",
            "value": "Richard"
        },
        {
            "key": "RichardBaseRep1",
            "value": "Ehh... I wish it would all be over..."
        },
        {
            "key": "Sam",
            "value": "Sam"
        },
        {
            "key": "SamBaseRep1",
            "value": "I hope the mantises don't invade the village like last time..."
        }
    ]
}